      "text": {
        "jp": "心配だけど、大丈夫じゃないか。\r\nああいうやつは、結構しぶといからな。",
        "official_en": "I’d be surprised, too, but people like that are usually as tough as nails. I’m sure he’ll be fine.",
        "real_en": "I'm worried, but he'll probably be fine. Guys like him are pretty tough."
