      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "盗んだものは、オレのもの！\r\n「返せ」と言われて、返すやつなどいないっ！",
        "official_en": "What I’ve rightfully stolen is mine! And what’s mine is <text style=\"italic\">mine</>!",
        "real_en": "Anything I've stolen belongs to me! Who'd give it back just because someone said <text style=\"italic\">'Give it back!'</>?"
